                </div>
                <small class="form-text text-muted">Ch?n c�c v?i c� s?n cho s?n ph?m n�y. Kh�ch h�ng s? c� th? ch?n t? c�c v?i n�y khi thi?t k?.</small>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group mb-3">
                <div class="form-check">
